2. ELASTIC BLOCK STORAGE 
Elastic Block Storage (EBS) is a high-performance, persistent block storage service 
provided by Amazon Web Services for use with virtual servers. 
It allows you to store data reliably and access it like a traditional hard drive attached to your 
cloud instance. 
